"Use a conversation ID (C/G/D...), not a channel or user name. * covers connected conversations only. Mention means the connected app or bot. Keyword: up to 120 characters. Reactions: up to 8 emoji names; empty means any. Self-only matching is unavailable. Clear incompatible filters when switching matches." = "请使用对话 ID（C/G/D…），不是频道或用户名。* 仅涵盖已连接的对话。“提及”指已连接的 App 或机器人。关键词最多 120 字符；表情最多 8 个名称，留空代表不限。不支持仅限本人。切换匹配模式时，请清除不兼容的筛选。";
"Select at least one event. CI requires one exact branch and ignores allowed users; each completed push workflow is separate, not an all-checks summary. Optional users: up to 50 logins, comma-separated. They filter PR owners, review actors and PR owners together, or the actor assigning an issue (not the assignee). Empty means any." = "请至少勾选一种事件。CI 必须指定单一精确分支，且不应用用户筛选；每次 push 工作流完成会分别判断，并非所有检查的汇总结果。可选填最多 50 个登录名，以逗号分隔。按事件筛选 PR 作者、同时筛选审查操作者与 PR 作者，或分配议题的操作者（不是被分配者）。留空代表不限。";
"Use 1 to 8 flat cron, GitHub, Slack, Linear, Sentry or PagerDuty conditions. Any one can trigger the same task. Nested groups and other platforms are not supported. No invalid condition is ignored." = "请使用 1 至 8 个平面 cron、GitHub、Slack、Linear、Sentry 或 PagerDuty 条件。任一条件都可触发同一项任务。不支持嵌套分组及其他平台；任何无效条件都不会被忽略。";
"Time conditions use the earliest next run; simultaneous time matches run once without catch-up. Event and manual runs also reset interval timers. Each approved time zone stays fixed. More conditions may cause more runs and model costs." = "时间条件取最早的下次运行时间；同时命中的时间条件只运行一次，不补跑。事件及手动运行也会重置间隔计时。各自批准的时区保持固定。更多条件可能带来更多运行次数与模型费用。";
"Any one condition can trigger this same task (OR, not AND). A delivery matching several conditions is included once. Different deliveries may cause additional runs and model costs. Each condition keeps its own filters; no new connections or permissions are granted." = "任一条件都可触发同一项任务（OR，而非 AND）。同一条事件即使命中多个条件，也只纳入一次。不同事件可能造成额外运行及模型费用。每个条件各自保留筛选限制，不会新增连接或授予权限。";
"Use one Slack trigger with a conversation ID (C/G/D...) or *, and match kind mention, message, keyword (up to 120 characters), or reaction (up to 8 emoji names). Channel/user names and bySelf true are unsupported. Unknown fields and invalid filters are rejected." = "请使用单个 Slack 触发条件：会话 ID（C/G/D…）或 *，以及 mention、message、keyword（最多 120 字符）或 reaction（最多 8 个表情名称）。不支持频道／用户名与 bySelf true。未知字段及无效筛选条件会被拒绝。";
"Slack requires an existing authenticated connection; no webhook is installed or started. Use conversation IDs, not names. * matches all delivered conversations across connections. Mentions mean app/bot mentions; mentions and reactions require verified event ingress. Verified event ingress accepts only plain human messages and added reactions to messages. An empty emoji list allows any emoji. Own-user filtering is unavailable. Queued events may trigger after approval and incur model costs." = "Slack 需要现有且已验证的连接；此操作不会安装或启动 webhook。请用会话 ID，不能用名称。* 涵盖各连接传入的所有会话。提及是指提及 App／机器人；提及和表情事件需要已验证的事件接收入口。已验证的事件入口仅支持普通用户消息及对消息添加的表情回应。表情列表留空代表任何表情。不支持仅筛选自己的操作。排队中的事件可能在批准后触发并产生模型费用。";
"Create own routine" = "创建自己的计划";
"Update own routine" = "修改自己的计划";
"Current routine" = "当前计划";
"Proposed routine" = "拟定的计划";
"Enabled routines may incur future model costs. New or rescheduled tasks start after approval without catch-up. Already started or queued runs keep their original task. This does not grant tools or permissions." = "启用的计划日后可能产生模型费用。新增或重新安排的任务从批准后开始，不补执行之前错过的次数。已开始或排入队列的执行会保留原任务内容。此操作不会授予工具或权限。";
"Routine create needs name, prompt and either schedule or a cron/GitHub/Slack/Linear/Sentry/PagerDuty trigger, never both. Update needs your own id and at least one changed field. Only name, prompt, schedule, trigger and boolean enabled are supported." = "创建计划需要 name、prompt，以及 schedule 或 cron/GitHub/Slack/Linear/Sentry/PagerDuty trigger，两者不可同时指定。修改需要自己的 id 及至少一个更改字段。仅支持 name、prompt、schedule、trigger 和布尔值 enabled。";
"Routine writes support time schedules, GitHub/Slack/Linear/Sentry/PagerDuty events, or flat groups of up to eight time/event conditions. Each time condition needs a valid explicit time zone and a next run within 366 days; intervals must be between one minute and 366 days." = "任务写入支持时间计划、GitHub/Slack/Linear/Sentry/PagerDuty 事件，或最多八个时间／事件条件的平面组合。每个时间条件须指定有效时区，且 366 天内须有下次运行时间；间隔须介于 1 分钟与 366 天。";
"Each GitHub condition needs a concrete owner/repo, known events, optional userAllowlist (up to 50 logins) and ciBranch. CI events require one valid branch. Unknown fields, events and invalid filters are rejected." = "每个 GitHub 条件须指定明确的 owner/repo、已知事件，以及可选的 userAllowlist（最多 50 个登录名）与 ciBranch。CI 事件须指定一个有效分支。未知字段、事件及无效筛选条件都会被拒绝。";
"GitHub events require an existing authenticated connection. This does not install or start a webhook. Queued events may trigger after approval. An empty user list allows everyone; PR events filter authors, review events require both author and actor. CI ignores the user list and watches one branch: each push workflow completion, not aggregate checks. Future runs may incur model costs." = "GitHub 事件须有已验证的连接；此操作不会安装或启动 webhook。批准后，队列中的事件可能触发计划。用户列表留空代表不限对象；PR 事件筛选作者，审查事件要求作者与操作人都在列表内。CI 忽略用户列表，只监视一个分支的每次 push workflow 完成事件，不是汇总所有检查。未来运行可能产生模型费用。";
"The agent cannot create enabled routines or edit protected routines while spend protection applies. Review Automations first." = "费用保护生效时，代理人不能创建启用的计划或修改受保护的计划。请先到“自动化”中查看。";
