"For avatar changes, use target avatar with action set and a listed pet_id, or action clear without pet_id. Paths, URLs and other fields are not supported." = "更改头像时，请使用 target avatar、action set 和列表中的 pet_id；或使用 action clear 且不提供 pet_id。不支持路径、网址或其他字段。";
