"Resume own routine" = "恢复自身自动化";
"Task and trigger" = "任务与触发条件";
"Delete own routine" = "删除自身自动化";
"Routine ID" = "自动化 ID";
"Delete removes this routine and prevents future triggers. There is no undo. Execution history stays in storage; already started or queued runs are not cancelled." = "删除会移除此自动化并停止后续触发，且无法撤销。执行历史仍保留在存储中；已开始或已排入执行队列的任务不会被取消。";
"Pause disables future triggers. Already started or queued runs are not cancelled. Task, trigger and history stay unchanged." = "暂停会停用后续触发，不会取消已开始或已排入执行队列的工作。任务、触发条件及历史记录保持不变。";
"Resume enables future triggers and may incur model costs. It does not run immediately or replay missed runs. Task, trigger and history stay unchanged." = "恢复会启用后续触发，可能产生模型费用。不会立即执行或补跑错过的工作。任务、触发条件及历史记录保持不变。";
"Use target routine with action pause, resume or delete and the id of your own existing automation. Other fields and routine actions are not supported." = "请使用 target routine、action pause、resume 或 delete，并提供自身现有自动化的 id。不支持其他字段或自动化操作。";
"The automation is unavailable, belongs to another agent, or already has the requested state." = "此自动化不可用、属于其他代理，或已处于请求的状态。";
"The automation changed while awaiting approval. Inspect it and request approval again." = "等待批准期间自动化已更改。请检查当前设置后重新请求批准。";
"This automation cannot be resumed by the agent. Review its spend protection and trigger in Automations." = "代理无法恢复此自动化。请到“自动化”检查费用保护及触发条件。";
"x-pagerduty-signature: only comma-separated v1=HMAC(rawBody) candidates; body digest prevents replay within the cache window; signed event.id identifies events; X-Webhook-Id is diagnostic only; occurred_at is event time, not delivery freshness" = "x-pagerduty-signature：只接受以逗号分隔的 v1=HMAC(rawBody) 候选值；正文摘要在缓存时限内防止重放；已签名的 event.id 标识事件；X-Webhook-Id 仅供诊断；occurred_at 是事件时间，不能证明送达是近期发生";
"PagerDuty supports incidentTriggered, incidentAcknowledged, incidentResolved, incidentEscalated or incidentAny, with optional serviceIds (up to 50 exact case-sensitive ID strings, 1 to 200 characters each). Empty means any service. No name lookup or wildcard IDs. Whitespace, control characters, unknown fields and invalid filters are rejected." = "PagerDuty 支持 incidentTriggered、incidentAcknowledged、incidentResolved、incidentEscalated 或 incidentAny，可选填 serviceIds（最多 50 个区分大小写的精确 ID 字符串，每个 1 至 200 字符）。空白表示任意服务。不提供名称查找或通配符 ID。空白字符、控制字符、未知字段及无效筛选条件均会被拒绝。";
"PagerDuty requires existing authenticated ingress; no webhook or connection is installed or started. Supports incident triggering, acknowledgment, resolution and escalation; incidentAny matches these four cases only. Service filters use exact case-sensitive IDs with no name lookup; empty means any service. Replay protection is bounded; occurred_at is event time, not delivery freshness. Queued events may trigger after approval and incur model costs." = "PagerDuty 需要已有且通过验证的事件入口；不会安装或启动 webhook 或连接。支持事故触发、确认、解决及升级；incidentAny 仅涵盖这四种事件。服务筛选采用区分大小写的精确 ID，不查找名称；空白表示任意服务。防重放有时限；occurred_at 是事件时间，不能证明送达是近期发生。已排入队列的事件可能在批准后触发，并产生模型费用。";
"Teams outgoing webhook Authorization: HMAC base64(HMAC(rawBody)); signing key is base64 text or decoded bytes. HMAC verifies transport, not Filicon user sign-in. Replay protection is bounded; no signed timestamp proves freshness." = "Teams 传出 webhook 使用 Authorization: HMAC base64(HMAC(rawBody))；签名密钥可为 base64 文本或已解码字节。HMAC 仅验证传输来源，不代表用户已登录 Filicon。重放防护有范围限制；没有已签名时间戳可证明新鲜度。";
"Teams native ingress supports only outgoing channel messages with an explicit text filter. Graph team UUIDs require aadGroupId; Bot team IDs are separate. Signed-in-user matching and root-post classification are unavailable. This editor keeps blockUnauthenticatedUsers enabled, so Teams event conditions do not run. No account, Graph subscription or webhook is installed." = "Teams 原生事件入口仅支持设有明确文本筛选的传出频道消息。Graph 团队 UUID 需要 aadGroupId；Bot 团队 ID 属于不同命名空间。目前不支持已登录用户匹配及主帖分类。此编辑器保留启用 blockUnauthenticatedUsers，因此 Teams 事件条件不会执行。不会安装账号连接、Graph 订阅或 webhook。";
"Issue created" = "问题已创建";
"Issue status changed" = "问题状态已更改";
"Cycle completed" = "周期已完成";
"Issue resolved" = "问题已解决";
"Issue assigned" = "问题已分配";
"Issue archived" = "问题已归档";
"Issue reopened" = "问题已重新打开";
"Any supported issue event" = "任何支持的问题事件";
"Incident triggered" = "事故已触发";
"Incident acknowledged" = "事故已确认";
"Incident resolved" = "事故已解决";
"Incident escalated" = "事故已升级";
"Any supported incident event" = "任何支持的事故事件";
"Team UUIDs" = "团队 UUID";
"Project UUIDs" = "项目 UUID";
"New status UUIDs" = "新状态 UUID";
"Cycle UUIDs" = "周期 UUID";
"Project IDs (digits only)" = "项目 ID（仅限数字）";
"Service IDs (case-sensitive)" = "服务 ID（区分大小写）";
"Optional filters: enter up to 50 IDs per field, separated by commas. Empty means any. Use IDs, not names or wildcards." = "可选筛选条件：每栏最多输入 50 个 ID，以逗号分隔。留空表示不限。请使用 ID，不接受名称或通配符。";
"Requires an existing verified event connection. Creating a routine does not connect an account or start a webhook. Future matching events may incur model costs." = "需要已有且已验证的事件连接。创建例行任务不会连接账号或启动 webhook。后续符合条件的事件可能产生模型费用。";
"Status filters apply only to status changes. Cycle completion uses team/cycle IDs, not projects, and requires an explicit completion event, not just an elapsed date. Clear incompatible filters when switching events." = "状态筛选仅适用于状态变更。周期完成使用团队／周期 ID，不支持项目；必须收到明确的完成事件，仅日期到期不会触发。切换事件时，请清除不适用的筛选条件。";
"Edit routine" = "编辑例行任务";
"Routine conditions" = "例行任务条件";
"Any one matching condition can trigger this routine." = "任一条件符合即可触发此例行任务。";
"Saving keeps the owner, enabled state, spend protection and run history. It does not run the routine now. Changed schedules restart from save time; already queued events may match new conditions and incur model costs." = "保存会保留所有者、启用状态、费用保护及执行历史，不会立即执行例行任务。更改的时间条件会从保存时间重新计算；已入队事件可能符合新条件并产生模型费用。";
"Enter a nonempty name (up to 80 characters) and instruction (up to 32,000 characters)." = "请输入非空白名称（最多 80 个字符）及任务内容（最多 32,000 个字符）。";
"This routine changed or was deleted while editing. Close the editor and reopen the latest version. Your draft has not been saved." = "编辑期间此例行任务已被修改或删除。请关闭编辑器并重新打开最新版本。你的草稿尚未保存。";
"This trigger cannot be edited here. Its original definition is preserved; you can still edit the name and instruction." = "此处无法编辑这种触发条件。原始定义会保留；仍可修改名称与任务内容。";
"This editor is no longer active, or its agent is unavailable. Close it and reopen the routine." = "此编辑器已失效，或代理不可用。请关闭后重新打开例行任务。";
"Enter the exact UUID of an existing connector. Names and wildcard connectors are not supported." = "请输入现有连接器的准确 UUID。不支持名称或通配连接器。";
"Enter an event kind of 1 to 128 characters, with no control characters or surrounding whitespace." = "请输入 1 至 128 个字符的事件类型，不可包含控制字符或首尾空白。";
"Filters must be a JSON object of at most 16 KiB, without duplicate keys. Maximum depth is 16 and maximum values is 4,096. Numbers allow up to 256 characters and exponent magnitude 10,000." = "筛选条件必须是最多 16 KiB、没有重复键的 JSON 对象。最大深度为 16，最多 4,096 个值。数字最多 256 个字符，指数绝对值上限为 10,000。";
"Uses the exact connector UUID and event kind; no connection is created. All top-level JSON filters must match. Nested objects and arrays match exactly; value types are not converted. An empty object matches any valid object payload from this connector and kind." = "按准确的连接器 UUID 和事件类型匹配，不会创建连接。所有顶层 JSON 条件都必须匹配；嵌套对象与数组必须完全相同，不转换值的类型。空对象会匹配此连接器与事件类型的任何有效对象数据。";
"Connector event" = "连接器事件";
"Memory search accepts only query (up to 256 Unicode scalars), scope all/agent/user, or a continuation cursor by itself." = "记忆搜索只接受 query（最多 256 个 Unicode 标量值）、scope all/agent/user，或单独的续页游标。";
"This memory search cursor is invalid or the saved facts changed. Start a new search." = "记忆搜索游标无效，或已保存的事实已有变更。请重新搜索。";
"This request reached its 32 memory-search limit. Report the results already available." = "此请求已达 32 次记忆搜索上限。请报告目前已有的结果。";
"Save reusable workflow" = "保存可复用工作流程";
"Rewrite reusable workflow" = "改写可复用工作流程";
"Current workflow" = "当前工作流程";
"Proposed workflow" = "提议的工作流程";
"Full workflow body" = "工作流程全文";
"Known direct references" = "已知的直接引用";
"This is a shared workflow, not private memory. All agents in this local workspace may reference it and send its body to their models. Existing and future routines or workflows may use the new body; renaming may break name-based references. Saving does not run or schedule anything, grant tools, or change permissions. Already running requests keep their captured content." = "这是共享工作流程，不是私人记忆。此本地工作区的所有代理都可能引用它，并将内容发送给各自的模型。现有及未来的计划任务或工作流程可能使用新内容；重命名可能使按名称引用失效。保存不会执行或安排任何工作，也不会授予工具或更改权限。运行中的请求保留启动时获取的内容。";
"Direct references are a snapshot, not the full affected audience; indirect and future references may also use this workflow. At most 100 direct references are listed." = "直接引用列表仅反映检查当时，不涵盖所有受影响对象；间接及未来的引用也可能使用此工作流程。最多列出 100 条直接引用。";
"Workflow write requires name, description and body within the supported limits, with no execution or permission fields." = "保存工作流程须提供限制范围内的名称、说明及全文，不得包含执行或权限字段。";
"Only your own local manual single-prompt workflows can be rewritten. Source-linked, managed and other agents' workflows are not writable here." = "只能改写自己的本地、手动、单一提示工作流程。此处不能改写关联来源、受管理或其他代理的工作流程。";
"The workflow library changed while awaiting approval. Request approval again." = "等待批准期间工作流程库已更改，请重新请求批准。";
"Workflow enabled" = "工作流程已启用";
"Workflow disabled" = "工作流程已停用";

/* Explicit deletion of an owned reusable workflow. */
"Delete reusable workflow" = "删除可重用工作流";
"This permanently removes the shared workflow definition. There is no undo. Existing run history remains visible by workflow ID. Runs that already captured its content are not cancelled. Other workflows and routines stay unchanged, including their schedules; future references may fail or omit this content. Files, sources, connections and permissions are not removed or changed." = "这会永久移除共享工作流定义，无法撤销。现有运行历史仍可按工作流 ID 查看。已获取流程内容的运行不会被取消。其他工作流、自动化及其计划均保持不变；未来引用可能失败或跳过此内容。不会移除或更改文件、来源、连接或权限。";
"Workflow deletion requires only target, action and an exact workflow ID." = "删除工作流仅接受 target、action 及准确的工作流 ID。";
"Only your own local manual single-prompt workflows within the review limit can be deleted here. Source-linked, managed and other agents' workflows are protected." = "此处仅能删除你自己的本地手动、单一提示工作流，且内容须在审阅上限内。关联来源、受管理及其他代理的工作流均受保护。";

/* Per-agent update notifications. */
"Agent update notifications" = "代理人更新通知";
"Notify when this agent finishes or needs input" = "此代理人完成工作或需要输入时通知";
"Update notifications on" = "更新通知已开启";
"Update notifications off" = "更新通知已关闭";
"Controls this local agent's completion and needs-input system alerts. Applies across groups and accounts using this profile. Does not mute conversation alerts or hide approval cards, unread counts or Dock badges. Tasks, visibility and permissions stay unchanged. System alerts require macOS notification permission. Past alerts are not replayed." = "控制此本机代理人完成工作与等待输入的系统通知，适用于使用此代理人资料的所有群组与账号。不会静音对话通知，也不会隐藏批准卡片、未读数或 Dock 标记。任务、显示状态与权限均不变。系统通知仍需 macOS 通知权限，且不会补发过去的通知。";
"Settings changes require only target settings, action set and a boolean notify_on_updates. Sidebar visibility and other settings are not supported." = "设置变更仅接受 target settings、action set 与布尔值 notify_on_updates。不支持侧栏显示状态或其他设置。";
"Agent notification settings changed. Reopen the editor or request approval again." = "代理人的通知设置已变更。请重新打开编辑器或再次请求批准。";
"Before" = "变更前";
"After" = "变更后";
// Own-channel disconnection approval
"Connection enabled" = "已启用";
"Connection disabled" = "已停用";
"Disconnect agent channel" = "断开代理人频道";
"Platform" = "平台";
"Account / channels" = "账号／频道";
"Status" = "状态";
"Inbound records to remove" = "将移除的接收记录";
"Delivery records to remove" = "将移除的发送记录";
"Pending / in-flight sends" = "待发送／发送中";
"Failure records to remove" = "将移除的失败记录";
"Removes this local connection and its inbound, delivery and failure records. Pending sends are removed; already accepted callbacks or sends may finish. No undo. Chat history and attachment files remain. Other connections and routines are unchanged. Keychain credentials are retained because they may be shared. Remote messages and OAuth grants are not revoked. Channel data changes require fresh approval." = "移除此本机连接及其接收、发送和失败记录。待发送项目会移除；已接受的回调或发送仍可能完成。无法撤销。聊天记录与附件文件保留，其他连接与计划不变。钥匙串凭据可能共享，因此保留；不撤回远程消息或 OAuth 授权。频道数据变更后须重新批准。";
"Channel disconnection requires only target channel, action disconnect and platform slack or discord." = "频道断开只能使用 target channel、action disconnect，以及 platform slack 或 discord。";
"No channel connection owned by this agent is available for that platform." = "此平台没有属于这位代理人的可用频道连接。";
"This agent has multiple connections on that platform. Choose the exact connection in Channels instead." = "此代理人在该平台有多个连接，请到“频道”选择要断开的确切连接。";
"Channel data changed while awaiting approval. Request approval again." = "等待批准期间频道数据已变更，请重新请求批准。";
"Teams event execution unavailable" = "Teams 事件执行目前不可用";
"Tenant UUID" = "租户 UUID";
"Graph UUIDs or exact Bot team IDs, comma-separated" = "Graph UUID 或精确的 Bot 团队 ID，以逗号分隔";
"Literal message filter (required, up to 120 characters)" = "消息文本筛选（必填，最多 120 个字符）";
"Each ID list accepts up to 50 entries before removing duplicates. Empty channel IDs means every channel in the selected teams. UUIDs ignore case; Bot and channel IDs are exact. Text matches a case-insensitive substring, including replies, not regex. Saving does not enable Teams event execution." = "每个 ID 列表在去除重复前最多 50 项。频道 ID 留空表示所选团队的所有频道。UUID 不区分大小写；Bot 与频道 ID 需精确匹配。文本以不区分大小写的子字符串匹配，也包含回复，不支持正则表达式。保存不会启用 Teams 事件执行。";
"Teams needs one tenant UUID and 1 to 50 team IDs. Channel IDs are optional (up to 50). Use Graph team UUIDs or exact Bot team IDs; no name lookup. IDs must be 1 to 200 UTF-8 bytes, without whitespace, control characters, commas or wildcards. Empty comma items are invalid." = "Teams 需要一个租户 UUID 与 1 到 50 个团队 ID。频道 ID 可留空，最多 50 个。请用 Graph 团队 UUID 或精确的 Bot 团队 ID，不会查询名称。ID 长度须为 1 到 200 个 UTF-8 字节，不可包含空白、控制字符、逗号或通配符。逗号之间不可有空项。";
"Enter a literal Teams message filter of 1 to 120 characters, without control characters. Empty filters and regular expressions cannot be edited here." = "请输入 1 到 120 个字符的 Teams 消息文本筛选，不可含控制字符。此处无法编辑空白筛选或正则表达式。";
"This editor preserves the Teams signed-in-user restriction and supports literal text only. Existing conditions with a different policy or regex remain read-only; name and instruction edits preserve them." = "此编辑器保留 Teams 已登录用户限制，且只支持文本匹配。采用不同策略或正则表达式的现有条件保持只读；修改名称与指令时会原样保留。";
"Collaboration project membership" = "协作项目成员资格";
"Create and join project" = "创建并加入项目";
"Join existing project" = "加入现有项目";
"Leave project" = "离开项目";
"Project member" = "已加入项目";
"Not a project member" = "未加入项目";
"Project member count" = "项目成员数";
"Project names and descriptions are shared with current and future agents in this account and their models. Only this agent's membership changes; other members and existing metadata stay unchanged. Leaving preserves the project. This does not create a chat or folder, grant file access, start work or share private memories. Project memory is not available yet." = "项目名称与说明会与此账号现有及未来的代理及其模型共享。仅更改此代理的成员资格，其他成员与现有资料保持不变。退出后仍保留项目。不会创建聊天或文件夹、授权文件访问、开始工作或共享私人记忆。尚不支持项目记忆。";
"Project changes accept create/join/leave and one exact lowercase slug (letters, digits and single hyphens, up to 64 bytes). Create also requires a name (up to 200 UTF-8 bytes) and optional description (up to 1,000 UTF-8 bytes), without control characters. No paths or permission fields." = "项目变更支持创建／加入／退出，须提供准确的小写标识符（英文字母、数字及单个连字符，最多 64 字节）。创建时须提供名称（最多 200 UTF-8 字节），说明可选（最多 1,000 UTF-8 字节），均不可含控制字符。不接受路径或权限字段。";
"The project or active agent is unavailable in this account." = "此账号中找不到该项目或可用的代理。";
"This agent already has the requested project membership. Nothing changed." = "此代理的项目成员资格已符合要求，未作更改。";
"This account already has 50 collaboration projects. No project was created." = "此账号已有 50 个协作项目，未创建新项目。";
"Project membership changed while approval was pending. Request approval again." = "等待批准时项目成员资格已更改，请重新请求批准。";
"Project memory" = "项目记忆";
"Save project memory" = "保存项目记忆";
"Forget project memory" = "忘记项目记忆";
"Forget this fact for all project members?" = "要为所有项目成员忘记此事实吗？";
"This editor lists all project facts in this account, including departed writers. Agents can read only projects they currently belong to." = "此编辑器列出此账号所有项目事实，包括已离开的记录者。代理只能读取目前所属项目。";
"Project facts are shared with current and future members of that project in this account and their configured models, including members outside this chat. Leaving stops future recall, not saved facts or already-sent messages. Rejoining restores access. Private memories and tool permissions stay unchanged." = "项目事实会与此账号中该项目现有及未来的成员和其配置的模型分享，包括此聊天以外的成员。离开后停止后续召回，但不删除已存事实或已发送消息；重新加入会恢复访问。私人记忆及工具权限不变。";
"Project memory requires an active member of an existing project in this account. Use an exact project slug with scope project only." = "项目记忆需要此账号现有项目的有效成员资格。精确项目标识只能搭配 project 范围。";
"This fact is already saved in this project's shared memory." = "此事实已保存在此项目的共享记忆中。";
"Each project's shared memory is limited to 48 facts, including 8 foundational facts, and 12,000 characters across all writers in this account." = "每个项目在此账号的所有记录者合计最多 48 个事实，其中基础事实最多 8 个，总计 12,000 字符。";
"Use memory write/forget with one fact of at most 1,000 characters, scope agent/user/project, and tier profile/log/note. Project scope requires an exact joined project slug. Forget requires exact recorded text, the same scope/project, and no tier." = "记忆写入／忘记限一个不超过 1,000 字符的事实，范围为 agent/user/project，层级为 profile/log/note。项目范围需精确指定已加入的项目；忘记时须使用原文、相同范围与项目，不指定层级。";
"Memory search accepts query (up to 256 Unicode scalars), scope all/agent/user/project, and an optional exact project slug with scope project only, or a continuation cursor by itself." = "记忆搜索接受查询（最多 256 个 Unicode 标量）、all/agent/user/project 范围；仅 project 范围可加精确项目标识。或单独提供继续游标。";
"Project names and descriptions are shared across this account. Joining also permits recall of approved project facts from current and departed writers; future members receive the same access. Leaving preserves those facts but stops future recall; rejoining restores access. Already-sent messages are not erased. Private memories, chats, files and tool permissions stay unchanged." = "项目名称与说明在此账号内共享。加入也可召回现有及已离开记录者所保存、经批准的项目事实，未来成员享有相同访问权。离开会保留事实但停止后续召回；重新加入会恢复访问。已发送消息不会删除。私人记忆、聊天、文件及工具权限不变。";

/* Bounded Teams model proposals: definitions do not enable Teams execution. */
"Routine create needs name, prompt and either schedule or a supported trigger, never both. Update needs your own id and at least one changed field. Only name, prompt, schedule, trigger and boolean enabled are supported." = "创建计划需提供名称、任务内容，以及时间计划或支持的触发条件，两者不可并用。更新需使用自己的计划 ID，且至少更改一个字段。仅支持名称、任务内容、时间计划、触发条件及布尔启用状态。";
"Use 1 to 8 flat supported conditions. Executable branches use OR; restricted Teams conditions cannot execute. Nested groups and unsupported platforms are rejected. No invalid condition is ignored." = "请使用 1 至 8 个平面支持条件。可执行的分支采用任一匹配（OR）；受限的 Teams 条件无法执行。不支持嵌套组或不支持的平台，不会忽略任何无效条件。";
"Routine writes support valid time schedules, supported platform events and restricted Teams definitions. Groups allow up to eight flat conditions. Time zones must be valid, with a next run within 366 days; intervals must be between one minute and 366 days." = "计划写入支持有效的时间计划、支持的平台事件及受限的 Teams 定义。组最多八个平面条件。时区必须有效，下次运行须在 366 天内；间隔须介于一分钟与 366 天之间。";
"Teams proposals need a tenant UUID, 1 to 50 exact team IDs, up to 50 channel IDs and literal text of 1 to 120 characters. No regex, wildcards, control characters, guessed IDs or relaxed sign-in policy. Teams events cannot execute until trusted user identity is available." = "Teams 提案需要租户 UUID、1 至 50 个精确团队 ID、最多 50 个频道 ID，以及 1 至 120 字的纯文本筛选。不可使用正则表达式、通配符、控制字符、猜测的 ID 或放宽登录限制。在取得可信用户身份之前，Teams 事件无法执行。";
"Approval saves a Teams definition only. Teams events cannot run because trusted user identity is unavailable; the signed-in-user restriction stays on and regex stays off. Use exact IDs and literal text; empty channel IDs allow any channel in the selected teams. Other OR conditions and explicit Run Now may still run and incur model costs. No connection, login or tool permissions are granted." = "批准只会保存 Teams 定义。由于尚无可信的用户身份验证，Teams 事件无法执行；登录用户限制保持开启，正则表达式保持关闭。请使用精确 ID 与纯文本；频道 ID 留空表示所选团队的所有频道。其他 OR 条件及明确的“立即运行”仍可能执行并产生模型费用。此操作不授予连接、登录或工具权限。";
