"Runs may incur model costs; no price or whole-group budget guarantee is provided." = "执行可能产生模型费用；此功能不保证价格或整个群组的预算上限。";
"Scheduled, event and manual runs will use this exact group's shared runner and transcript. Each member uses its own model and persona. Tools retain their existing approval gates; this does not grant file, browser, connection or action permissions. Busy groups are not interrupted or retried. Changes to the routine, group or members require another review." = "定时、事件与手动执行会使用这个群组的共享执行流程与对话记录。每位成员使用自己的模型及角色设定。工具仍须通过原有批准；此同意不会授予文件、浏览器、连接或其他操作权限。忙碌的群组不会被中断，也不会自动重试。排程、群组或成员变更后须重新批准。";
"New, independent consent: each reviewed member may send its own permitted private facts, shared user facts and joined-project facts to its configured model provider during this routine. Existing scope and project membership restrictions still apply. Delegation outside this group does not extend memory consent. This does not authorize publishing unrelated private facts or collecting suggestions, episodes or synthesis from routine seeds. Off disables memory recall, search and changes for this run." = "这是一项新的独立同意：此排程执行期间，每位已批准成员可将自己的允许使用之私人事实、用户共享事实，以及已加入项目的事实传给其设定的模型供应商。原有范围及项目成员限制仍然适用。委派给群组外代理人不会延伸记忆同意。此同意不允许发布无关的私人事实，也不会从排程起始消息收集记忆建议、片段或合成资料。关闭时，此次执行不能回想、搜索或修改记忆。";
